### Root
GET http://localhost:1198/


### Health Check
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/health


### Upload Single File
### Change ./sample-files/test.pdf to any local file path you want to upload
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=FileBoundary

--FileBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="godaddy payment.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample-files/goodaddy payment.pdf
--FileBoundary--


### Upload Multiple Files
### Change the local file paths as needed
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files/upload/multiple
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MultiFileBoundary

--MultiFileBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="ideamajesty-trees-5555938.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample-files/ideamajesty-trees-5555938.jpg
--MultiFileBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="DB2F5798E1959EE292E3835B4ED9BA1A.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./sample-files/DB2F5798E1959EE292E3835B4ED9BA1A.txt
--MultiFileBoundary--


### Get All File Metadata
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files


### Pagination limit 5
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files?page=1&limit=5

### Pagination limit 2
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files?page=1&limit=2

### Pagination page 2 limit 2
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files?page=2&limit=2

### Search By Original Filename
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files?search=godaddy

### Search By Original Filename
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files?search=test


### Filter By MIME Type
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files?mimeType=application/pdf


### Filter By Extension
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files?extension=pdf


### Filter Images Only
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files?isImage=true


### Sort By File Size Ascending
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files?sort=size&order=asc


### Sort By File Size Descending
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files?sort=size&order=desc


### Combined Query
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files?search=image&isImage=true&sort=createdAt&order=desc&page=1&limit=10

### 
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files?search=idea&isImage=true&sort=createdAt&order=desc&page=1&limit=10


### Get File Metadata By ID
### Replace FILE_ID with a real MongoDB file document ID
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files/FILE_ID

### Get File Metadata By ID
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files/6a82d55d6762116a688b1b65

### View / Stream File Inline
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files/6a82d55d6762116a688b1b65/view

### Download File
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files/6a82d55d6762116a688b1b65/download


### View / Stream File Inline
### Replace FILE_ID with a real MongoDB file document ID
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files/FILE_ID/view


### Download File
### Replace FILE_ID with a real MongoDB file document ID
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files/FILE_ID/download


### Delete File
### Replace FILE_ID with a real MongoDB file document ID
DELETE http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files/FILE_ID

### Delete File
DELETE http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files/6a82d55d6762116a688b1b66

### confirm delete
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files/6a82d55d6762116a688b1b66


### Invalid File ID
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files/invalid-id


### Missing File Upload
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=EmptyBoundary

--EmptyBoundary--


### Unsupported File Type
### Example executable upload should be rejected
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=UnsupportedBoundary

--UnsupportedBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="app.exe"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< ./sample-files/app.exe
--UnsupportedBoundary--


### Invalid Query
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/files?page=0&limit=500


### Invalid Route
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/not-found